# The games image (Dockerfile.games) needs the bot folder, the arena server's source and lockfile, the vendored Kessel
# package and the forceteki source; keep the rest out, and what a local checkout builds (packages, forceteki's build
# and card data, a local server's data, caches).
# BuildKit reads this file for Dockerfile.games; fly.games.toml names it as the ignore file for flyctl.
*
!package.json
!bot
!server/package.json
!server/package-lock.json
!server/src
!vendor/kessel
!forceteki
forceteki/.git
forceteki/node_modules
forceteki/build
forceteki/test/json
**/target
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
